00:56:36.240 --> 00:56:46.320
<v Ira Glass>Thanks to Elizabeth Meister, who runs the site. Thanks to Joanne, Rob, and Dale of the Cola Mail system for hosting our weekly email news update. This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International.

00:56:46.320 --> 00:57:07.020
